{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RPG-Inspired Deep Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you will unlock and develop more than 20 skills and combos, allowing you to create your own unique action style. Test your abilities against 20 different creatures and forge your own path to victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/607b1c49b80337a03db33c849aaf8935.avif?t=1759437741\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dramatic Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey begins with Nora, whose life changes forever when Luna suddenly disappears one morning. What starts as a mystery soon evolves into a profound tale of survival and confrontation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.poster.avif?t=1759437741\" width=632 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.webm?t=1759437741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.mp4?t=1759437741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No action game is complete without epic boss fights. Prepare yourself for brand-new challenges and intense action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.poster.avif?t=1759437741\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.webm?t=1759437741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.mp4?t=1759437741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fantastic Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luctus invites you into a brand-new, original universe. Discover new races, new lands, new creatures, and new gods.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.poster.avif?t=1759437741\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.webm?t=1759437741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.mp4?t=1759437741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luctus is a story-driven action-adventure game brought to life with pixel art aesthetics. A rich universe and unforgettable characters await, offering a deeply immersive experience. The dramatic tale of Nora intertwines with action-packed moments and epic boss battles.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Skier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2567380/8506f48c5e6183d491810a0f8d5f3097ed2eff76.jpg"},{"name":"Easy Prey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2567380/d7f8857c18a02f90d08a4b83166d7d454b168fc3.jpg"},{"name":"Face Me All!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2567380/c788f346dddbf70efb6d698b41aa55a1b76b9bfb.jpg"},{"na